  "body": "Given `new URL(\"db://x/y/z\")`.\r\n\r\nChrome, Firefox, Edge:\r\n```js\r\npathname: \"//x/y/z\",\r\n```\r\nNodeJS:\r\n```js\r\nhostname: 'x',\r\npathname: '/y/z',\r\n```\r\n-----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nGiven `new URL(\"file:x/y/z\")`.\r\n\r\nChrome, Edge:\r\n```js\r\nhost: \"x\"\r\npathname: \"/y/z\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nFirefox, NodeJS:\r\n```js\r\npathname: \"/x/y/z\"\r\n```",
